opam-version: "2.0"
synopsis: "MSVC from the environment"
description: """
opam's ocaml-env-msvc64 adds the directories conf-msvc64 found to PATH,
INCLUDE and LIB. The pixi environment sets them already (dev/setup/activate.bat), so this one
adds nothing."""
